{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论：信息的本质与结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nature-of-information","title":"信息的本质：从香农到 Floridi","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations/nature-of-information","wordCount":1286,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"levels-of-abstraction","title":"抽象层次方法：系统分析的认识论工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations/levels-of-abstraction","wordCount":757,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-semantics","title":"信息语义学：意义、真值与虚假信息悖论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations/information-semantics","wordCount":1001,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础理论-信息的本质与结构\">基础理论：信息的本质与结构</h1><p>本章从信息哲学的本体论基础出发，探讨三个相互关联的核心问题：信息究竟是什么、如何通过抽象层次方法研究系统、以及语义信息如何区别于纯统计信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"nature-of-information\">信息的本质</a></td>\n<td>Shannon vs 语义 vs GDI</td>\n<td>信息的三层定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"levels-of-abstraction\">抽象层次方法</a></td>\n<td>LoA 作为认识论工具</td>\n<td>可观察量、界面、层次转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"information-semantics\">信息语义学</a></td>\n<td>Bar-Hillel/Carnap 理论</td>\n<td>语义内容、虚假信息悖论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"章节定位\">章节定位</h2><p>基础理论为整个 hub 奠定概念基础。信息的本质定义决定了认识论如何处理信息与知识的关系，抽象层次方法提供了分析工具，语义信息理论则是伦理和治理讨论的前提。</p>\n"}